        "id": 6255
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-10-01T04:57:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Y\u0027know, it feels a little silly to physically pad out this buffer when the padding\u0027s only purpose is to force a `permute` call after writing the initial block. We could just call `c.permute` directly.\n\nBut that\u0027s probably an idea for another CL.",
      "revId": "b63376a92f7929fc9c1b5f53f354a484f7a91adf",
      "serverId": "62eb7196-b449-3ce5-99f1-c037f21e1705"
